@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title Member Design, Review and Consultation Flow
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

|Member|
start
:Open saved design or design-request workspace;
if (Consultation?) then (yes)
  :Start context-linked or general consultation;
  |Staff or Manager|
  :Claim/assign within role scope;
  :Exchange immutable UTF-8 messages;
  |Member|
  :Close conversation or continue;
else (Custom request)
  :Submit description/images/design snapshot;
  |System|
  :Validate ownership, consent and image quality;
  :Set NEED_REVIEW;
  |Staff or Manager|
  :Review request;
  :Record decision and mandatory explanation;
  |Member|
  :Read result or submit clarification;
endif
stop
@enduml
